        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "371de288-7c64-54e3-8886-55793fc6bbcc",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Rick Hart, Steven Seagal, Tommy Lee Jones, Gary Busey, J. F. Lawton, J.D. Athens\n- Works: Under Siege, Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, V.I.P., Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death, Pizza Man\n- Awards: Academy Award for Best Sound\n- Places: USS Missouri\n\nFacts:\n- Rick Hart was nominated for an Academy Award for Best Sound for the film Under Siege.\n- Under Siege stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop mercenaries led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey aboard the U.S. Navy battleship USS Missouri.\n- J. F. Lawton's screen credits include Pretty Woman, Mistress, Blankman, Under Siege, The Hunted, Chain Reaction, Jackson, and the TV series V.I.P.\n- Under the name J.D. Athens, J. F. Lawton wrote and directed Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death and Pizza Man.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
        "id": 1,
        "original_id": "48654126-1d63-58c7-b7c4-afbd88e48ec1",
        "text": "Page: Rick Hart (sound engineer). Sentence: He was nominated for an Academy Award in the category Best Sound for the film \"Under Siege\".\nPage: Under Siege. Sentence: It stars Steven Seagal as an ex-Navy SEAL who must stop a group of mercenaries, led by Tommy Lee Jones and Gary Busey, on the U.S. Navy battleship USS \"Missouri\".\nPage: J. F. Lawton. Sentence: His screen credits include the box office hit \"Pretty Woman\", \"Mistress\", \"Blankman\", \"Under Siege\", \"\", \"The Hunted\", \"Chain Reaction\", \"\", \"Jackson\", and the TV series \"V.I.P.\" Under the assumed name \"J.D. Athens\", he wrote and directed \"Cannibal Women in the Avocado Jungle of Death\" and \"Pizza Man\".",
